  "an10.188:1.1": "vo bhikkhave dhammaṃ desissāmi sukhavipākañ ca, ",
  "an10.188:1.2": "taṃ suṇātha . . . pe . . . 2. ",
  "an10.188:1.3": "Katamo ca bhikkhave dukkhavipāko dhammo? ",
  "an10.188:1.4": "Pāṇātipāto . . . pe . . . ",
  "an10.188:1.5": "micchādiṭṭhi. ",
  "an10.188:1.6": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave dukkhavipāko dhammo. 3. ",
  "an10.188:2.1": "Katamo ca bhikkhave sukhavipāko dhammo? ",
  "an10.188:2.2": "Pāṇātipātā veramaṇī . . . pe . . . ",
  "an10.188:2.3": "sammādiṭṭhi. ",
  "an10.188:2.4": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave sukhavipāko dhammo ",
  "an10.188:2.5": "ti. 1. ",
  "an10.188:2.6": "Ariyamaggañ ca "
